    <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>Jailbreaking always carries some brick risk if you use the wrong files or firmware version. SpringBreak itself is a software-only exploit that runs from a webpage and does not require opening the device. Follow the author&rsquo;s instructions exactly, verify your model and firmware, and back up your data first. Done correctly on a supported device, it is about as safe as jailbreaks get.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
