        <p>SpringBreak targets mass-storage devices: Kindle 10th Gen (2019), Kindle 11th Gen (2022), Paperwhite 4 (2018), and Paperwhite 5 including the Signature Edition (2021). Newer 2024+ models that connect over MTP block the exploit&rsquo;s cache-injection vector and are not supported.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
