    <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
      <div itemprop="text">
        <p>Yes. KOReader and the jailbreak tools run alongside the stock Kindle firmware. You can switch back to the normal interface to buy and download books from Amazon, then switch to KOReader to read EPUB files natively. The two environments coexist on the same device.</p>
      </div>
